<title>BANGLADESH: Bangladesh's forex market shut for public holiday.</title>
<headline>Bangladesh's forex market shut for public holiday.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bangladesh's foreign exchange market was closed on Wednesday for a public holiday.</p>
<p>The Bangladesh currency taka quoted at 43.8200/8300 against dollar at the close of interbank trading on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Dhaka Newsroom +880-2-506363</p>
